#. module: purchase
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase.field_product_category__property_account_billed_not_received_id
msgid ""
"Account holding the accrued value of the goods billed but not received yet. "
"With perpetual valuation, it counterbalances the stock valuation account at "
"closing."
msgstr ""
"ບັນຊີທີ່ບັນທຶກມູນຄ່າຄ້າງຮັບຂອງສິນຄ້າທີ່ຮຽກເກັບເງິນແລ້ວແຕ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຮັບເຄື່ອງ. "
"ໃນລະບົບບັນທຶກສິນຄ້າແບບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ, ມັນຈະປັບຍອດດຸນກັບບັນຊີມູນຄ່າສາງເມື່ອປິດບັນຊີ."

#. module: purchase
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase.field_product_category__property_account_bills_to_receive_id
msgid ""
"Account holding the accrued value of the goods received but not billed yet. "
"With perpetual valuation, it counterbalances the stock valuation account at "
"closing."
msgstr ""
"ບັນຊີທີ່ບັນທຶກມູນຄ່າຄ້າງຈ່າຍຂອງສິນຄ້າທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບແລ້ວແຕ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນຮຽກເກັບເງິນ. ໃນລະບົບບັນທຶກສິນຄ້າແບບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ, "
"ມັນຈະປັບຍອດດຸນກັບບັນຊີມູນຄ່າສາງເມື່ອປິດບັນຊີ."

